---
import LegalPage from '@/layouts/LegalPage.astro';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Support"
  eyebrow="Help and assistance"
  updatedAt="September 14, 2026"
  description="Guidance for getting help with the Dinn platform and Dinn Pharma Stock for ChatGPT."
  lang="en"
  langLinks={{ pt: '/suporte', en: '/en/support', es: '/es/soporte' }}
>
  <section>
    <h2>Access and connection</h2>
    <p>
      If your account, company, portfolio, or features do not appear as
      expected, contact your company's Dinn administrator or use the support
      channel defined in your contract. For Dinn Pharma Stock, indicate
      whether the problem occurred while connecting, authorizing, selecting
      the tool, or viewing the response.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How to report an issue</h2>
    <p>To speed up diagnosis, send through your contracted channel:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>approximate date, time, and time zone;</li>
      <li>the step where the problem occurred;</li>
      <li>error message and screenshot, when possible;</li>
      <li>company and expected business scope, without including credentials;</li>
      <li>expected result and observed result.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="legal-callout">
      <strong>Never send a password, token, OAuth code, or patient data.</strong>
      The Dinn team does not need this data to start assistance.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Data and availability</h2>
    <p>
      When reporting discrepancies, indicate the product, retail network,
      region, and displayed cutoff date. Observed and estimated values may
      have different nature and freshness. The team will verify behavior
      according to the scope and service level set out in your company's
      contract.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Privacy and security</h2>
    <p>
      To exercise data subject rights or contact the Data Protection Officer,
      write to
      <a href="mailto:vinicius.silva@diwe.com.br">vinicius.silva@diwe.com.br</a>.
      For suspected unauthorized access or an incident, immediately use your
      contracted support channel and ask for it to be classified as a
      security incident.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Public information</h2>
    <p>
      See also the <a href="/en/terms-of-use">Terms of Use</a> and the
      <a href="/en/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. To learn about the
      product or request a demo, use the "Request a demo" button on the
      corporate website.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
